  "_comment": [
    "What the stub model answers for the extract step of exercise 10.",
    "",
    "Every rule matches on `image`, not on text, and that is the whole lesson",
    "of a per_part step: the prompt is the same template on page one and page",
    "four, and what differs between the two calls is the picture. The stage",
    "key says the same thing -- the part is in it by content hash and nothing",
    "else about it is (R3.12).",
    "",
    "The digests are sha256 prefixes of the pages as the shipped converters",
    "render them. Regenerate them with:",
    "    python playground/toolkit/make_observability_docs.py --digests",
    "",
    "There is no `default` on purpose. A stub that invented an answer for a",
    "page no rule names would turn a stale digest into a puzzle about",
    "grounding; a 422 says which call had no rule."
  ],
